<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101751" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφύζω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφύσδω</span></b> , only pres.
		and impf.:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throb, beat violently</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφυγμός</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				2.5.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.6.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Judic.</u>
				33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				11.71
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>beat</i>, of the pulse, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὸ αἷμα ἐν ταῖς φλεψί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					521a6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηδῶσα</span>
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷον τὰ σφύζοντα</span>
			like
			<i>the veins</i> or <i>arteries</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				251d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέρος</span> [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβρύου] μήτε θερμὸν μήτε σφύζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.63
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph. of
			any violent motion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφύζοντος καὶ σφαδᾴζοντος καὶ πηδῶντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					p.201
				</span></i>
			 H., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				221
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἐπὶ ταῦτα</span>
			<i>to be very eager</i> after . . , <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> prob. f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				19.6
			</span></i>.</div>
